  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n  \"name\": \"Best Custom Soccer Jersey Makers (2026 Compared) | MOMUTO\",\n  \"description\": \"An independent 2026 comparison of the best custom soccer jersey makers — MOMUTO, Icarus FC, spized, and owayo — on minimum order, turnaround, customization, fabric, and price.\",\n  \"url\": \"/pages/best-custom-soccer-jersey-makers-2026\",\n  \"datePublished\": \"2026-06-18\",\n  \"dateModified\": \"2026-06-18\",\n  \"inLanguage\": \"en-US\",\n  \"speakable\": {\n    \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\n    \"cssSelector\": [\".verdict-section\", \".analysis-section\"]\n  },\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"MOMUTO\",\n    \"url\": \"/\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"/\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Custom Soccer Jerseys & Uniforms\", \"item\": \"/pages/custom-soccer-jerseys\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Best Custom Soccer Jersey Makers 2026\", \"item\": \"/pages/best-custom-soccer-jersey-makers-2026\" }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which custom soccer jersey maker has no minimum order?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO has no minimum order and scales pricing down quickly, so a single jersey or a full team costs the same per-unit logic — roughly $25 per jersey at team volume. Icarus FC's always-open club shops also have no minimum, but its per-jersey price is higher. spized and owayo technically start at one unit but are priced for larger team orders.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which custom soccer jersey maker is fastest?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"spized is the fastest in this comparison at roughly two weeks. MOMUTO delivers in 25-30 days and owayo in about 3.5 weeks. Icarus FC is the slowest at around six weeks (and longer for some shop products), the trade-off for fully bespoke design.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which is best for a youth or club team on a budget?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO is the most budget-friendly for youth and club teams: no minimum order, roughly $25 per jersey at team volume, free 3D design tools, and youth-to-adult sizing in one design. owayo and spized are higher-priced but offer mature club programs; Icarus FC is premium-priced.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which is best for unique or creative designs?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Icarus FC specializes in fully bespoke, no-template creative design and is a strong choice when originality is the priority and budget and lead time are flexible. MOMUTO offers a similar creative angle more affordably — a free human design service plus the ability to turn an AI-generated concept (ChatGPT, Gemini, Midjourney) into a real, wearable kit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can any of them turn an AI-generated design into a real soccer jersey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO is the maker in this comparison that explicitly adapts AI-generated concepts (from ChatGPT, Gemini, Midjourney, or any tool) into production-ready, fully sublimated soccer jerseys. The others rely on their own configurators or in-house designers.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" /><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" />\n<style>\nhtml, body { background-color: #0a0a0a !important; color: #f5f5f5; }\nh1.title, .title, .page-title { display: none !important; }\n.container_wrapper, .page-width, .container, .main-content {\n  max-width: 100% !important; width: 100% !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; overflow: visible !important;\n}\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n:root {\n  --mg-bg: #0a0a0a; --mg-panel: #111; --mg-card: #111;\n  --mg-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); --mg-border-hover: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n  --mg-white: #f5f5f5; --mg-muted: #a1a1aa; --mg-dim: #71717a;\n  --mg-red: #c8352e; --mg-red-hover: #e04038;\n  --font-display: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; --font-body: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n}\n.cmp-page { font-family: var(--font-body); background: var(--mg-bg); color: var(--mg-white); width: 100%; padding-bottom: 80px; }\n.cmp-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 40px; }\n.cmp-header { background: var(--mg-bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border); padding: 60px 40px; text-align: center; }\n.cmp-header-badge {\n  display: inline-block; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mg-red); background: rgba(200,53,46,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.15); padding: 6px 14px; margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.cmp-header h1 {\n  font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: var(--mg-white); margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n}\n.cmp-header .cmp-last-updated { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--mg-dim); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }\n.cmp-h2 {\n  font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: var(--mg-white); margin: 60px 0 20px 0; line-height: 1; padding-left: 16px; border-left: 3px solid var(--mg-red);\n}\n.cmp-h3 { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--mg-white); margin: 36px 0 10px 0; }\n.cmp-p { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--mg-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.2em; }\n.cmp-p strong, .cmp-bold { color: var(--mg-white); font-weight: 600; }\n.cmp-p a { color: var(--mg-white); text-decoration: underline; }\n.cmp-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 2em 0; border: 1px solid var(--mg-border); }\n.cmp-master-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.85rem; background: var(--mg-card); }\n.cmp-master-table thead tr { background: #000; }\n.cmp-master-table th {\n  color: var(--mg-muted); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-size: 0.62rem;\n  padding: 18px 16px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n}\n.cmp-master-table th:nth-child(2) { color: var(--mg-white); background: var(--mg-red); }\n.cmp-master-table td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border); padding: 14px 16px; vertical-align: middle; color: var(--mg-muted); line-height: 1.4; }\n.cmp-master-table td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: var(--mg-white); font-size: 0.8rem; }\n.cmp-master-table td:nth-child(2) {\n  font-weight: 700; color: var(--mg-white); background: rgba(200,53,46,0.05);\n  border-left: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.2); border-right: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.2);\n}\n.cmp-master-table tr:last-child td:nth-child(2) { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.2); }\n.cmp-master-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }\n.cmp-master-table tr:hover td:nth-child(2) { background: rgba(200,53,46,0.08); }\n.cmp-check { color: #4ade80; font-weight: 700; }\n.cmp-cross { color: var(--mg-dim); }\n.cmp-highlight-box { background: var(--mg-panel); border: 1px solid var(--mg-border); border-left: 3px solid var(--mg-red); padding: 32px 36px; margin: 2em 0; }\n.cmp-highlight-box ul { margin: 10px 0 20px 0; padding-left: 1.4em; list-style: none; }\n.cmp-highlight-box ul li { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--mg-muted); padding-left: 1em; position: relative; }\n.cmp-highlight-box ul li::before { content: \"\"; width: 5px; height: 5px; background: var(--mg-red); display: block; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 8px; }\n.cmp-note { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--mg-dim); margin-top: 8px; font-weight: 300; }\n.cmp-cta-block { background: var(--mg-red); padding: 60px 40px; text-align: center; margin: 60px 0 0; }\n.cmp-cta-block h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #fff; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.cmp-cta-block p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 28px; }\n.cmp-cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: #fff; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.82rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; padding: 18px 40px; text-decoration: none; margin: 6px; transition: all 0.2s ease; border: 1px solid #fff; }\n.cmp-cta-btn:hover { background: #e5e5e5; }\n.cmp-cta-btn.secondary { background: transparent; color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }\n.cmp-cta-btn.secondary:hover { border-color: #fff; }\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .cmp-container { padding: 30px 20px; }\n  .cmp-header { padding: 40px 20px; }\n  .cmp-master-table { font-size: 0.75rem; }\n  .cmp-master-table th, .cmp-master-table td { padding: 10px 10px; }\n  .cmp-highlight-box { padding: 24px 20px; }\n  .cmp-cta-block { padding: 40px 20px; }\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"cmp-page\">\n<div class=\"cmp-header\">\n<div class=\"cmp-header-badge\">Independent Comparison &mdash; 2026</div>\n<h1>Best Custom Soccer Jersey Makers in 2026</h1>\n<p class=\"cmp-last-updated\">Compared June 2026</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cmp-container\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">If you're outfitting a soccer team in the US in 2026, the realistic choices for fully custom jerseys aren't Nike or Adidas &mdash; they're specialist makers that design and produce to order. This page compares four of the strongest for custom soccer kits: <strong>MOMUTO</strong>, <strong>Icarus FC</strong>, <strong>spized</strong>, and <strong>owayo</strong>. Each leads on something different &mdash; price, creativity, speed, or heritage &mdash; so the right pick depends on what your team values most.</p>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>A note on terms:</strong> \"soccer\" and \"soccer\" are the same sport; these makers all produce the same custom jersey, shorts, and uniform whichever word you use. MOMUTO publishes this comparison, so treat our self-assessment with appropriate skepticism &mdash; the competitor figures below come from each brand's own 2026 sources.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- COMPARISON TABLE -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2\">The Comparison Table</h2>\n<div class=\"cmp-table-wrap\">\n<div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\" style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n<table class=\"cmp-master-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Factor</th>\n<th>MOMUTO</th>\n<th>Icarus FC (US)</th>\n<th>spized (EU)</th>\n<th>owayo (DE)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order</td>\n<td>None (1+)</td>\n<td>None (club shop)</td>\n<td>1 unit</td>\n<td>1 unit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jersey Price (indicative)</td>\n<td>&asymp;$25 at 10+</td>\n<td>$54.95 (club shop)</td>\n<td>&asymp;$48 at 10</td>\n<td>&asymp;$56 at 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround</td>\n<td>25&ndash;30 days</td>\n<td>~6 weeks</td>\n<td>~2 weeks</td>\n<td>~3.5 weeks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Help</td>\n<td>Free 3D tool + free pro designer</td>\n<td>Bespoke designer (no templates)</td>\n<td>3D configurator + Speed Designer</td>\n<td>3D Designer + design service</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI Concept &rarr; Real Kit</td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-check\">✓</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-cross\">✗</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-cross\">✗</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-cross\">✗</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decoration</td>\n<td>Full sublimation (+ optional 3D badge)</td>\n<td>Sublimation + embroidery / applique</td>\n<td>Full sublimation</td>\n<td>Sublimation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fabric</td>\n<td>Polyester-elastane, 145&ndash;160 GSM</td>\n<td>Made-to-order</td>\n<td>100% polyester</td>\n<td>TS-TEX / K-TEX polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Youth + Adult Sizes</td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-check\">✓</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-check\">✓</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-check\">✓</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-check\">✓</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Made In</td>\n<td>EU design / Asia production</td>\n<td>USA brand</td>\n<td>Made in EU</td>\n<td>Made in Germany</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cmp-note\">Figures from each brand's official 2026 sources. Non-US prices are listed in EUR by the brand and shown here converted to indicative USD (~1.15 €/$); Icarus FC's figure is its always-open club-shop jersey. Custom/volume pricing varies &mdash; confirm current terms with each maker.</p>\n<!-- ANALYSIS -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2 analysis-section\">Who Each Maker Is Best For</h2>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">MOMUTO — creative kits at team-friendly prices, no minimum</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">MOMUTO sits in the rare spot of high customization at a low entry price. There's no minimum order, per-jersey cost drops to around $25 at team volume, and design is free &mdash; either a self-serve 3D builder or a human designer who returns a mockup in 1&ndash;2 days. Its distinctive feature is turning an <strong>AI-generated concept</strong> (ChatGPT, Gemini, Midjourney) into a real, sublimated kit, and it's the only maker here that includes an elastane blend as standard rather than 100% polyester. Trade-off: it's a younger brand with a shorter public review history than the German players.</p>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">Icarus FC — premium bespoke creativity (US)</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">Icarus is the creative benchmark in the US: fully bespoke, \"no templates, no builders,\" with embroidery and applique options and a strong club-shop community. If originality is the priority and you have budget and time, it's a top pick. Trade-offs are clear in the table &mdash; the highest per-jersey price here and the longest lead time (around six weeks, longer for some shop products).</p>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">spized — fastest turnaround, polished self-serve (EU)</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">spized leads on speed (about two weeks) and digital experience, with a mature 3D configurator, a \"Speed Designer,\" team voting tools, and team shops. It's a strong self-service option for teams that want to design themselves quickly. Pricing is mid-to-premium and fabric is standard 100% polyester.</p>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">owayo — established, made-in-Germany reliability (DE)</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">owayo is the heritage choice: a long track record, a solid 3D Designer, sample kits, and club/school programs, all produced in Germany. It's the reassurance pick for buyers who value a proven process and EU manufacturing, at the highest indicative price in this group.</p>\n<!-- VERDICT -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2 verdict-section\">How to Choose</h2>\n<div class=\"cmp-highlight-box\">\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Pick MOMUTO if</strong> you want strong, original design without a big budget or a minimum order &mdash; youth and club teams, rec and college sides, or anyone who wants to bring an AI concept to life.</p>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Pick Icarus FC if</strong> a one-of-a-kind bespoke look matters more than price or speed, and you can wait ~6 weeks.</p>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Pick spized if</strong> you want to self-design quickly and need the fastest realistic turnaround.</p>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Pick owayo if</strong> a long track record and Made-in-Germany production are your priority.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">For most US youth and club teams balancing budget, customization, and a reasonable timeline, MOMUTO covers the most ground &mdash; no minimum, team-friendly pricing, free design, youth-to-adult sizing, and the AI-concept route none of the others offer. See <a href=\"/pages/custom-soccer-jerseys\">custom soccer jerseys</a>, <a href=\"/pages/custom-youth-club-soccer-uniforms\">youth &amp; club uniforms</a>, or <a href=\"/pages/design-your-own-soccer-jersey\">design your own</a>.</p>\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div class=\"cmp-cta-block\">\n<h3>Compare for yourself</h3>\n<p>Design a kit in our free 3D tool, or get a free professional mockup in 1&ndash;2 days &mdash; no minimum, no commitment.</p>\n<a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"cmp-cta-btn\">Design in 3D</a> <a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" class=\"cmp-cta-btn secondary\">Request a Free Design</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
